                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <dateline rendition="#center">[From the Pajaro Verde, <placeName>Mexico</placeName>,
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-08-01">August 1,
                    1866</date>.]</dateline>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Eighty-first regiment of the
                        line.</hi></p>
                <p>A French soldier assures us the above regiment is allowed to return to France in
                    November; but as all can stay who wish, only the colonel and the band of music
                    will go back.</p>
                <p>We are not responsible for the above communication.</p>
            </div>
